                               Preamble

  Win11 Launcher is an independent, community-minded project that brings a
  desktop-style experience to Android phones. It was written for people who
  enjoy tinkering with their devices, and it is shared in the hope that it
  will be useful, educational, and fun to build upon.

  This license exists to keep that spirit simple. You are free to use the
  software, to study how it works, to change it, and to share it with others,
  including in commercial settings. In return, we ask for three things:
  that you give credit where it is due, that you are honest about changes
  you make, and that you respect the names and trademarks of others that
  appear around this project.

  The software is offered as a gift and as a work in progress. It comes
  with no promises about fitness, stability, or safety, and the people who
  made it cannot be held responsible for how it is used. The precise terms
  and conditions for use, copying, modification, and distribution follow.


